  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Air Border Data Systems in Nigeria &#x2013; Phase II (EABDS II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to the Government of Nigeria enhancing border security and travel facilitation through centralized data architecture with the IOM&#x2019;s Migration Information and Analysis System (MIDAS) platform and inter-agency cooperation. As a result, the Government of Nigeria will facilitate faster, safer and more reliable traveller processing at air borders through strengthened national data architecture, relevant legal framework and inter-agency cooperation. Also, relevant government agencies in Nigeria, will manage to conduct secondary inspection at international airports through a common investigative approach based on appropriate legal framework and strengthened inter-agency cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
